text: ["Activated abilities of creatures cost {1} less to activate. This effect can't reduce the mana in that cost to less than one mana.", 'All Slivers have "Pay 2 life: Return this permanent to its owner\'s hand."', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: This permanent deals 2 damage to any target."', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: You gain 4 life."', "All Slivers have shroud. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", 'All creatures block each combat if able.\nThe attacking player chooses how each creature blocks each combat.', "As Volrath's Laboratory enters the battlefield, choose a color and a creature type.\n{5}, {T}: Create a 2/2 creature token of the chosen color and type.", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nFling deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to any target.", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nReturn any number of target creatures you control to their owner's hand.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nSearch your library for a card with the same name as target nontoken creature, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'As long as the top card of your graveyard is a creature card, Volrath\'s Shapeshifter has the full text of that card and has the text "{2}: Discard a card." (Volrath\'s Shapeshifter has that card\'s name, mana cost, color, types, abilities, power, and toughness.)\n{2}: Discard a card.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player discards a card at random.", 'At the beginning of each upkeep, untap all creatures and lands.', 'Buyback {2}{B}{B} (You may pay an additional {2}{B}{B} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget opponent loses 2 life. You gain 2 life.', 'Buyback {2}{B}{B} (You may pay an additional {2}{B}{B} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget player discards a card.', 'Buyback {2}{U} (You may pay an additional {2}{U} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nFanning the Flames deals X damage to any target.', "Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget creature can't attack this turn.", 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget creature gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', "Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget land becomes a 2/2 creature that's still a land. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)", 'Buyback {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nCreate a 1/1 black Rat creature token.', 'Buyback—Sacrifice a land. (You may sacrifice a land in addition to any other costs as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Change the target of target spell that targets only a player. The new target must be a player.', 'Choose two target creatures controlled by the same player. Exile one of those creatures and put two +1/+1 counters on the other.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', "Craven Giant can't block.", "Creatures don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield, untap all creatures.", "Creatures with power greater than the number of cards in your hand can't attack.", 'Creatures you control gain reach until end of turn. (They can block creatures with flying.)', "Creatures you control have trample. (A creature with trample can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Crovax the Cursed enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice a creature. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Crovax. If you don't, remove a +1/+1 counter from Crovax.\n{B}: Crovax gains flying until end of turn.", 'Defender\nWhen Wall of Blossoms enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFirst strike", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nShifting Wall enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWhenever Wall of Essence is dealt combat damage, you gain that much life.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWhenever Wall of Souls is dealt combat damage, it deals that much damage to target opponent or planeswalker.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWhenever Wall of Tears blocks a creature, return that creature to its owner's hand at end of combat.", 'Destroy all creatures target player controls. For each creature that died this way, that player creates two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Destroy all nonbasic lands.', 'Destroy target blocked creature.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures.', 'Draw three cards, then discard a card.', "Dream Prowler can't be blocked as long as it's attacking alone.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+3.\n{W}: Return Conviction to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -3/-0.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to target creature this turn, prevent that damage."', "Enchant creature\nWhen enchanted creature attacks, return it and Contempt to their owners' hands at end of combat.", 'Enchant creature\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional {G}{G}.', 'First strike', "Flame Wave deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker and each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Spindrift Drake unless you pay {U}.', 'Flying\nCloud Spirit can block only creatures with flying.', "Flying\nRevenant's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.", 'Flying\nWhen Foul Imp enters the battlefield, you lose 2 life.', 'Flying\nWhenever Warrior Angel deals damage, you gain that much life.', 'Flying\n{0}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Spirit en-Kor this turn is dealt to target creature you control instead.', 'Flying\n{B}: Dungeon Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{U}: Change the target of target spell or ability that targets only Silver Wyvern. The new target must be a creature.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nSacrifice Shard Phoenix: It deals 2 damage to each creature without flying.\n{R}{R}{R}: Return Shard Phoenix from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only during your upkeep.", 'Flying, vigilance', "Hammerhead Shark can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'Haste\n{0}: Flowstone Hellion gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Haste\n{R}: Furnace Spirit gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "If Mox Diamond would enter the battlefield, you may discard a land card instead. If you do, put Mox Diamond onto the battlefield. If you don't, put it into its owner's graveyard.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.", 'If you would draw a card, you may put a study counter on Pursuit of Knowledge instead.\nRemove three study counters from Pursuit of Knowledge, Sacrifice Pursuit of Knowledge: Draw seven cards.', "Look at the top five cards of target player's library. Put any number of them on the bottom of that library in any order and the rest on top of the library in any order.", 'Mindwarper enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}{B}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Mindwarper: Target player discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Mob Justice deals damage to target player or planeswalker equal to the number of creatures you control.', "Mogg Flunkies can't attack or block alone.", 'Other black creatures get -1/-1.', 'Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Prevent the next X damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn. For each 1 damage prevented this way, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.', 'Put a card from your hand on top of your library: Prevent all damage that would be dealt by target instant or sorcery spell this turn.', 'Rather than pay the mana cost for a spell, its controller may discard a card that shares a color with that spell.', "Return all creatures to their owners' hands.", 'Reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all land cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice Morgue Thrull: Mill three cards.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhenever Soltari Champion attacks, other creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhenever Thalakos Deceiver attacks and isn't blocked, you may sacrifice it. If you do, gain control of target creature. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)", 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Skeleton Scavengers enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.\nPay {1} for each +1/+1 counter on Skeleton Scavengers: Regenerate Skeleton Scavengers. When it regenerates this way, put a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Spike Breeder enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Breeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Breeder: Create a 1/1 green Spike creature token.', 'Spike Colony enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Colony: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Spike Feeder enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: You gain 2 life.', 'Spike Soldier enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Soldier: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Soldier: Spike Soldier gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Spike Worker enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Worker: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Spitting Hydra enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\n{1}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spitting Hydra: It deals 1 damage to target creature.', 'Tap up to three target creatures without flying.', 'Target creature gains flying until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Trample\n{0}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Lancers en-Kor this turn is dealt to target creature you control instead.', 'Trample\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Carnassid.', 'Trample\n{R}: Flowstone Mauler gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Untap all creatures you control and all creatures target opponent controls. You and that opponent each gain control of all creatures the other controls until end of turn. Those creatures gain haste until end of turn.', "Untap target creature you don't control. That creature blocks this turn if able.\nDraw a card.", "Walking Dream can't be blocked.\nWalking Dream doesn't untap during your untap step if an opponent controls two or more creatures.", "Wall creatures can attack as though they didn't have defender.", 'When Serpent Warrior enters the battlefield, you lose 3 life.', 'When Venerable Monk enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'When a player casts a spell, sacrifice Hesitation and counter that spell.', 'When another creature enters the battlefield, sacrifice Mogg Bombers and it deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'When you control a creature with toughness 2 or less, sacrifice Endangered Armodon.', 'Whenever Lowland Basilisk deals damage to a creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever Mogg Maniac is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', 'Whenever a Sliver becomes blocked, that Sliver gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', "Whenever a creature blocks, Heat of Battle deals 1 damage to that creature's controller.", "Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, if there are two or more other creatures on the battlefield, exile that creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control when Portcullis leaves the battlefield.", 'Whenever a creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, put that card on top of your library.', 'Whenever a creature you control dies, each other player sacrifices a creature.', 'Whenever a nontoken permanent is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, Jinxed Ring deals 1 damage to you.\nSacrifice a creature: Target opponent gains control of Jinxed Ring. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', 'Whenever a player plays a land, that player draws a card.', 'Whenever a spell or ability an opponent controls causes a land to be put into your graveyard from the battlefield, return that card to the battlefield.', 'Whenever an opponent discards a card, Megrim deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent plays a land, you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Whenever you cast a spell, you gain 1 life.', '{0}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Nomads en-Kor this turn is dealt to target creature you control instead.', '{0}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Shaman en-Kor this turn is dealt to target creature you control instead.\n{1}{W}: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to target creature this turn, that damage is dealt to Shaman en-Kor instead.', '{0}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Warrior en-Kor this turn is dealt to target creature you control instead.', '{1}, Discard a card at random: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "{1}{R}: Target creature can't block Duct Crawler this turn.", '{2}, Tap an untapped creature you control: You gain 2 life. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{2}, {T}: Bullwhip deals 1 damage to target creature. That creature attacks this turn if able.', '{2}: Create a 1/1 colorless Sliver creature token.', '{3}, {T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Insect artifact creature token with flying and haste named Hornet. Destroy it at the beginning of the next end step.', '{B}, Discard a creature card: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "{B}, {T}: Corrupting Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {B} to end this effect.\nEnchanted creature has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", '{G}, {T}: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a basic land card. Put that card into your hand and all other cards revealed this way into your graveyard.', '{G}, {T}: Tempting Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {G} to end this effect.\nAll creatures able to block enchanted creature do so.', "{R}, {T}: Convulsing Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {R} to end this effect.\nEnchanted creature can't block.", '{R}: Flowstone Shambler gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Destroy target nonblack creature.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{B}, {T}: Put target creature card from your graveyard on top of your library.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Target blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}: Target creature gains shadow until end of turn. (It can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', '{T}: Target creature with flying gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}: Target land becomes an Island until end of turn.', '{T}: Target legendary creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{U}, {T}: Gliding Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {U} to end this effect.\nEnchanted creature has flying.', "{W}, {T}: Calming Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {W} to end this effect.\nEnchanted creature can't attack.", '{W}: Honor Guard gets +0/+1 until end of turn.']
